### ⚙️ How Morphing Works

| Stage               | Description                                                                                            |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Start**           | You issue `M 1 5 10` — morph from DE5 row 1 to 5 over 10 seconds                                       |
| **Interpolation**   | The script linearly interpolates all numeric DE5 parameters (e.g., torque, current target, inductance) |
| **Transmission**    | Each step sends a `MORPH:` packet (key=value pairs) to the MCU via UART                                |
| **Firmware Action** | The MCU firmware updates its internal control targets in real time                                     |
| **Visualization**   | A red dot moves smoothly along the DE5 torque–efficiency curve, showing the morph path                 |

